      "title": "How to create Trajectory JSON",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Tracks come from OmniCam\n\nDraw or project motion layers in the OmniCam Director's **Motion Tracks**\npanel, then queue. Monitor compiles them for this model and reports any\nlayer the target's format cannot carry.\n\nA track can be drawn by hand over the frame, or *projected*: pick a 3D\nobject or world point and let the animated camera project it to 2D for you."
      ],
